Archie: show full tab titles and a close button on every sidebar tab.

In the vertical tab strip, stock Chromium fades long titles out at the
sidebar edge and only shows the close (x) button on the active or
hovered tab. Instead:
  - long titles wrap onto extra lines (up to 6) and the tab grows to fit;
  - every unpinned tab shows its close button whenever the sidebar is
    wide enough, not just on hover.
Collapsed (icon-only) sidebars, pinned tabs and split tabs keep the
stock single-line layout, and titles only wrap once the sidebar has
finished expanding so tabs don't jump around mid-animation.

